{"title":"BLVK Nicotine Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBLVK Unicorn had everyone talking about their freebase nicotine ejuices when they first arrived to the vape scene and now they are doing it again with their nicotine salt eliquids. BLVK Unicorn nic salt is made up of five sweet fruit flavors: Apple, Grape, Honey Dew, Strawberry and Lychee. BLVK Unicorn offers their entire line in a 30ml bottle and nicotine salt strengths 35mg and 50mg.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"blvk-passion-grape-ice-fusion-salts","title":"BLVK Passion Grape Ice - Fusion Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Passion Grape Ice by BLVK Fusion, melding together tangy passionfruit, sweet grapes, and menthol for a delicious synthetic nicotine salt. **Warning: Not For Sub-Ohm Use**\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/blvk-nicotine-salts\" title=\"Blvk unicorn nic salts\"\u003eBLVK Unicorn\u003c\/a\u003e Fusion - Passion Grape Ice Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBLVK Fusion Line\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynthetic Nicotine Salts Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted for Ultra-Low Wattage \u0026amp; Pod-Based System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546096183,"sku":"BLVK - Grape Ice 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546128951,"sku":"BLVK - Grape Ice 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk_unicorn_-_fusion_-_passion_grape_ice_-_bottle.png?v=1747708342"},{"product_id":"blvk-aloe-pineapple-salts","title":"BLVK Aloe Pineapple Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Aloe Pineapple Salt by BLVK Salt, capturing the subtle flavors of aloe enhanced with tropical pineapple in a refreshing nicotine salt mixture. \u003cstrong\u003e**Warning: Not For Sub-Ohm Use**\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAloe Pineapple Salt - \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/blvk-nicotine-salts\" title=\"Blvk salts\"\u003eBLVK Salt\u003c\/a\u003e Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynthetic Nicotine Salt Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546161719,"sku":"BLVK Aloe Pineapple 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546194487,"sku":"BLVK Aloe Pineapple 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk-aloe-pineapple.jpg?v=1747708344"},{"product_id":"blvk-aloe-grape-salts","title":"BLVK Aloe Grape Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover Aloe Grape Salt by \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/blvk-nicotine-salts\" title=\"Blvk nic salt\"\u003eBLVK Nic Salt\u003c\/a\u003e, combining the refreshing flavor of mellow aloe and sweet table grapes in a synthetic nicotine salt blend. \u003cstrong\u003e**Warning: Not For Sub-Ohm Use**\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarning: This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in pod-based, closed systems devices, and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods. Every salt-based nicotine e-juice contains significantly higher levels of nicotine per milliliter, optimal for beginners or experienced vapers looking for a travel-friendly experience.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAloe Grape Salt - BLVK Salt Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynthetic Nicotine Salt Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546227255,"sku":"BLVK Aloe Grape 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546260023,"sku":"BLVK Aloe Grape 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Blvk-Aloe-Grape.jpg?v=1747708347"},{"product_id":"blvk-aloe-mango-salt","title":"BLVK Aloe Mango Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop Aloe Mango Salt by \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/blvk-nicotine-salts\" title=\"BLVK Salt\"\u003eBLVK Salt\u003c\/a\u003e, blending together notes of aloe combined with a splash of refreshing mango nectar in synthetic nicotine salt.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAloe Mango Salt - BLVK Salt Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynthetic Nicotine Salt Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546292791,"sku":"BLVK Aloe Mango 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546325559,"sku":"BLVK Aloe Mango 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Blvk-aloe-mango.jpg?v=1747708349"},{"product_id":"blvk-aloe-watermelon-salt","title":"BLVK Aloe Watermelon Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Aloe Watermelon Salt by \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/blvk-nicotine-salts\" title=\"Blvk salts\"\u003eBLVK Salts\u003c\/a\u003e, mixing refreshing notes of aloe enhanced with summertime watermelon with synthetic nicotine salt. \u003cstrong\u003e**Warning: Not For Sub-Ohm Use**\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarning: This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in pod-based, closed systems devices, and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods. Every salt-based nicotine e-juice contains significantly higher levels of nicotine per milliliter, optimal for beginners or experienced vapers looking for a travel-friendly experience.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAloe Watermelon Salt - BLVK Salt Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSynthetic Nicotine Salt Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546423863,"sku":"BLVK Aloe Watermelon 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546456631,"sku":"BLVK Aloe Watermelon 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Blvk-aloe-watermelon.jpg?v=1747708351"},{"product_id":"blvk-tobacco-nicotine-salt-pistachio","title":"BLVK Tobacco Nicotine Salt - Pistachio","description":"\u003cp\u003ePistachio Salt by BLVK Unicorn is a nicotine salt rendition of nutty pistachios combined with sweet leafy tobacco for a powerful vape that will inspire the senses and tastebuds.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning:\u003c\/strong\u003e This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in pod-based, closed systems devices, and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods. Every \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"nicotine salt base\"\u003esalt-based nicotine\u003c\/a\u003e e-juice contains significantly higher levels of nicotine per milliliter, optimal for beginners or experienced vapers looking for a travel-friendly experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBLVK Unicorn SALT - Pistachio Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Salts Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted For Ultra-Low Wattage \u0026amp; Pod-Based System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine: 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546522167,"sku":"BLVK Tobacco - Pistachio 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546554935,"sku":"BLVK Tobacco - Pistachio 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk_unicorn_-_salt_series_-_tobacco_salt_-_pistachio_-_box_bottle.png?v=1747708355"},{"product_id":"blvk-unicorn-nicotine-salt-icy-cucumber","title":"BLVK Unicorn Nicotine Salt - Icy Cucumber","description":"\u003cp\u003eCucumber SALT by BLVK Unicorn takes powerful nicotine salts and is combined with a healthy amount of cucumber slices and icy cool menthol to create a tasty eJuice that is sure to invigorate the taste buds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBLVK Unicorn – ICY CUCUMBER \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"nicotine salt\"\u003eNICOTINE SALT\u003c\/a\u003e Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e40% PG\u003cstrong\u003e\/\u003c\/strong\u003e60% VG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546587703,"sku":"BLVK - Icy Cucumber 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546620471,"sku":"BLVK - Icy Cucumber 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Cucumber-BLVK-Unicorn-Salt-Series-30ml.jpg?v=1747708359"},{"product_id":"blvk-pink-series-nicotine-salt-iced-peach-berry","title":"BLVK Pink Series Nicotine Salt - Iced Peach Berry","description":"\u003cp\u003eIced Berry Peach is a nicotine salt with the perfect blend of sun-ripen strawberries, delicious peach and satisfying menthol. An enriched profile of delicious strawberries and juicy peaches with the frozen pairing like no other. Make your summer cooler with Iced Berry Peach by BLVK PINK, an outstanding satisfaction of the finest Nicotine Salts with pleasure and mouth-watering taste! The wonderfully mixed duo fruits, strawberries and peach with the wonderful kick of cool menthol.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDON’T MISS THIS EXQUISITE AND EXTRAORDINARY MENTHOL AND MINT FLAVOR THAT PLEASES WITH FRESH BERRY AND PEACH. BUY NOW!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWARNING: THIS PRODUCT IS NOT DESIGNED FOR USE THAT REACH SUB-OHM RESISTANCE. IT IS MADE FOR THE USE IN POD DEVICES.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor – Cool things off with this icy pairing of sweet strawberries, and juicy peaches.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size – 30 ML\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Level – 35 MG, 50 MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG – 50 \/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIngredients – Propylene Glycol, Vegetable Glycerin, Natural \u0026amp; Artificial Flavors, Nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546653239,"sku":"BLVK - Iced Peach Berry 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546686007,"sku":"BLVK - Iced Peach Berry 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk-unicorn-pink-salt-iced-berry-peach-30ml-eliquid.jpg?v=1747708361"},{"product_id":"blvk-pink-series-nicotine-salt-iced-berry-lemonade","title":"BLVK Pink Series Nicotine Salt - Iced Berry Lemonade","description":"\u003cp\u003eIced Berry Peach is a nicotine salt with the perfect blend of sun-ripen strawberries, delicious peach and satisfying menthol. An enriched profile of delicious strawberries and juicy peaches with the frozen pairing like no other. Make your summer cooler with Iced Berry Peach by BLVK PINK, an outstanding satisfaction of the finest \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"nicotine salts\"\u003eNicotine Salts\u003c\/a\u003e with pleasure and mouth-watering taste! The wonderfully mixed duo fruits, strawberries and peach with the wonderful kick of cool menthol.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWARNING: THIS PRODUCT IS NOT DESIGNED FOR USE THAT REACH SUB-OHM RESISTANCE. IT IS MADE FOR THE USE IN POD DEVICES.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor – Cool things off with this icy pairing of sweet strawberries, and juicy peaches.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size – 30 ML\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Level – 35 MG, 50 MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG – 50 \/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIngredients – Propylene Glycol, Vegetable Glycerin, Natural \u0026amp; Artificial Flavors, Nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546718775,"sku":"BLVK - Iced Berry Lemonade 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546751543,"sku":"BLVK - Iced Berry Lemonade 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk_unicorn_iced_berry_lemonade_box_bottle.jpg?v=1747708364"},{"product_id":"blvk-pink-series-nicotine-salt-kiwi-berry-ice","title":"BLVK Pink Series Nicotine Salt - Iced Kiwi Berry","description":"\u003cp\u003eNow the BLVK Unicorn Salt series is taking over the scene with flavors like Kiwi Strawberry Ice, a fusion of strawberries, kiwi, and menthol packed into a smooth-hitting nicotine salt vape juice designed for low-wattage pod vapes.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKiwi Strawberry Ice provides a refreshing duet of sun-ripened strawberries, juicy kiwi chunks, and arctic menthol for a frozen fruit vape experience from inhale to exhale. This flavor is crafted using a 60% VG and 40% PG formula ratio, which means that each hit will balance intense flavors with small and thin clouds.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBLVK Unicorn Salt packages the Kiwi Strawberry Ice recipe in a 30ml-sized squeeze bottle with 35mg and 50mg nicotine strength options available here at \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/\" title=\"[YOUR BRAND]\"\u003e[YOUR BRAND]\u003c\/a\u003e. This flavor is designed for use with a low-wattage, refillable pod vape and should not be vaped using a sub-ohm device. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Kiwi, Strawberry, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG Ratio: 60% VG \/ 40% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Levels: 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41670546784311,"sku":"BLVK - Iced Kiwi Berry 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41670546817079,"sku":"BLVK - Iced Kiwi Berry 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Iced-Berry-Kiwi-BLVK-Pink-Collection-Salt-30ml.jpg?v=1747708366"},{"product_id":"blvk-unicorn-plus-salt-ice-watermelon","title":"BLVK Unicorn Plus Salt - Ice Watermelon","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop Salt Plus – Watermelon Ice by BLVK Unicorn, a nicotine salt blend of frozen watermelons juiced to extract the delightful nectar within.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBLVK Unicorn – Salt Plus – Watermelon Ice Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Salts Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted For Ultra-Low Wattage \u0026amp; Pod-Based System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning: This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in pod-based, closed systems devices, and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670546849847,"sku":"BLVK - Ice Watermelon 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670546882615,"sku":"BLVK - Ice Watermelon 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk_unicorn_salt_plus_salts_watermelon.jpg?v=1747708370"},{"product_id":"blvk-unicorn-plus-salt-ice-grape","title":"BLVK Unicorn Plus Salt - Ice Grape","description":"\u003cp\u003eTaste the amazing flavor of Salt Plus – Grape Ice by BLVK Unicorn, combining a strong grape overtone with a contrasting menthol chill for an uplifting iced grape vape flavor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBLVK Unicorn – Salt Plus – Grape Ice Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e40% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e60% VG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Salts Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted For Ultra-Low Wattage \u0026amp; Pod-Based System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning: This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in pod-based, closed systems devices, and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods.