08446"},{"product_id":"blvk-pink-series-nicotine-salt-iced-berry-banana","title":"BLVK Pink Series Nicotine Salt - Iced Berry Banana","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover ICED Berry BANANA Salts by BLVK Unicorn, featuring a frozen banana base accented with delicious notes of sweet strawberry in nicotine salts.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size – 30 ML\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Level – 35 MG, 50 MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG – 50 \/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIngredients – Propylene Glycol, Vegetable Glycerin, Natural \u0026amp; Artificial Flavors, Nicotine.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWARNING: THIS PRODUCT IS NOT DESIGNED FOR USE THAT REACH SUB-OHM RESISTANCE. IT IS MADE FOR THE USE IN POD DEVICES.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670548750391,"sku":"BLVK - Iced Berry Banana 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670548783159,"sku":"BLVK - Iced Berry Banana 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk_unicorn_-_iced_berry_banana_-_box_bottle.png?v=1747708448"},{"product_id":"blvk-fusion-salt-kiwi-pom-berry-ice","title":"BLVK Fusion Salt - Kiwi POM Berry Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Kiwi Berry Pom Ice by BLVK Fusion, introducing tangy kiwi, zesty pomegranate, and sweet strawberries served over ice in a nicotine salt blend.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBLVK Unicorn Fusion - Kiwi POM Berry Ice Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBLVK Fusion Line\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChild Resistant Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG\/50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Salt