tance. We recommend this liquid to be used in vape pod system and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41806978514999,"sku":"BLVK - Havana Tobacco - 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41806978547767,"sku":"BLVK - Havana Tobacco - 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk-nic-salt-havana-tobacco.webp?v=1754244585"},{"product_id":"blvk-bar-watermelon-gummy-salt","title":"BLVK Bar - Watermelon Gummy Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience smooth satisfaction with BLVK Bar Saltnic 30ml E-Liquid, crafted for rich flavor and a clean throat hit. This fruity blend delivers the tart kick of watermelon, a hint of sweetness, and a refreshing icy finish on every puff.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50\/50 VG\/PG — ideal for pod systems\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30 mL bottle with child-resistant cap\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePre-steeped and ready to vape\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in 35 mg \u0026amp; 50 mg nicotine\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the USA by BLVK Bar\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":42114915336247,"sku":"BLVK Bar - Watermelon Gummy 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":42114915369015,"sku":"BLVK Bar - Watermelon Gummy 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/watermelon-gummy-blvk-bar-nicotine-salt.webp?v=1771549690"},{"product_id":"blvk-bar-american-tobacco-salt","title":"BLVK Bar - American Tobacco Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience smooth satisfaction wi